    <briefdescription>
<para>Quantization-based compression strategy. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Reduces bit-depth of floating-point values to 8, 16, or 32 bits, with optional per-channel or per-layer scaling for better accuracy. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
